            {
                "category": "summary",
                "text": "NVIDIA has released security updates to address vulnerabilities in various products.",
                "title": "Summary"
            },
            {
                "category": "details",
                "text": "To protect your system, download and install the latest NVIDIA components from the <a href=\"https://enterprise-support.nvidia.com/s/\">NVIDIA Enterprise Support Portal</a>.<div>Custom versions of these products are also affected. If you are using a custom version, contact your account manager or CPM to get information about relevant patched versions to replace your custom version.</div>",
                "title": "Security Update Notes"
            },
            {
                "category": "details",
                "text": "For CVE-2026-24185, the issue is only applicable to systems that enable PKA-Only and require Admin operation on the certificate list to be triggered. The issue is only relevant for systems that do not maintain best practices for user passwords. Systems that don\u2019t use PKA-Only are not affected.",
                "title": "Mitigation Notes"
            },
            {
                "category": "details",
                "text": "These issues were found internally.<div><br></div>",
                "title": "Bulletin Notes"
            },
            {
