                "name": "Execution with Unnecessary Privileges"
            },
            "notes": [
                {
                    "category": "summary",
                    "text": "NVIDIA Cumulus Linux contains a vulnerability in the user management component, where an unprivileged user could use improper privilege management on the system. A successful exploit of this vulnerability might lead to escalation of privileges.",
